<h3>About</h3>
<p>The <%= link_to "Capability Maturity Model Integration (CMMI)", "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capability_Maturity_Model_Integration" %> is a collection of best practices that help organizations to improve their processes. 
</p>

<p>From 1974 to 1978, Oscar Goldman, OSI, famously said of his critically injured astronaut friend Steve Austin, "We can rebuild him. We have the technology. We can make him better than he was. Better, stronger, faster." </p>

<p>Sure, Oscar was right. But six million dollars! Really?? Today, "better, stronger, faster" is not enough. It's also got to be <strong>cheaper</strong>. And that's where the CMMI comes in. </p>

<p>CMMI Version 1.3 is a great read but its a static read. This site makes the model more accessible & dynamic.</p>

